---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Triangle from '../components/Triangle';
import Routine from '../components/Routine';

const fukuokaPins = [
  { type: 'eat' as const, label: 'Yanagibashi Market', coord: [33.590, 130.395] as [number, number] },
  { type: 'stay' as const, label: 'Hostel Toka', coord: [33.593, 130.401] as [number, number] },
  { type: 'work' as const, label: 'Manu Coffee', coord: [33.588, 130.398] as [number, number] },
];
---

<Base title="Framework — ogulcan.dev" description="The eat, stay, work triangle and routine — the backbone of a location-independent life.">
  <article class="centered-column">
    <header>
      <h1>Framework</h1>
      <p class="entry-meta">Interactive · eat, stay, work + routine</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The backbone of a location-independent life reads in three corners — <strong>eat</strong>, <strong>stay</strong>, <strong>work</strong>. Pick three points in a city and a triangle appears. Fukuoka, below:</p>
    </div>
    <Triangle pins={fukuokaPins} client:only="react" />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>An invisible fourth dimension holds the triangle up: <strong>routine</strong>. Routine is how the three corners get <em>repeated</em>. The same walk. The same sandwich shop. The same light in the same café. Stack three days and the shape becomes visible — that's what routine looks like:</p>
    </div>
    <Routine client:visible />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>For the full frame, read the <a href="/">preface</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
